# Run fix-login

Run these steps in order. Prompt, Agent and Fork steps only hand off: each goes to its skill or agents; never do that work yourself. Do every other step as its line says. Wait for each step's result before the next.

Hand-off files are read and written by bare name (\`<file>\`, not \`carousell-web/<file>\`) in the run's working folder. A run starts there; in this build's workspace that folder is \`carousell-web/\`. Never use the workspace folder itself.

1. NODE start (start): the run starts here. Then go on to NODE p.
2. NODE p (p): read \`\${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/skills/p/SKILL.md\` by path and follow it. Then go on to NODE a.
3. NODE a (a): dispatch \`fix-login:a\` with the prompt "NODE a\\nGo", and wait for it to return. Then go on to NODE stop.
4. NODE stop (stop): the run's output \`result\` (text) is ready.
",
